WEBVTT

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.360
Lost in the direction of a vast road ahead

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:28.400
Want to escape the cycle, be myself for once

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.500
Crashing into a chaotic world

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:36.790
Ever since I met you, my course has changed

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:42.040
Define the world as infinity

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:44.560
No need to be suspicious

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:46.260
No need to doubt

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:50.600
You're light, I'm darkness, in mutual opposition

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:52.880
Like the opposite ends of magnets

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.840
In natural tacit agreement

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:58.580
Quarrel gets reconciled in split seconds

00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:03.520
Can't see and can't hear in subtlety

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:08.820
You know what I'm thinking

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:13.080
Your trust is burning

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:18.160
is my smiling response to the world

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:20.460
Relying on each other

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:23.060
Vast potential to rewrite life

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:24.960
May be unexpected

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:26.920
In every circumstance

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:34.600
To face all battles together

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:37.500
Let the chains that bound us together

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:41.440
Converge into an unlimited, exciting

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:46.620
Splendor

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:50.540
Soul Contract

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:55.300
Second Contract

00:01:56.820 --> 00:01:58.690
Subbed by EP of Bayi Subs

00:01:58.690 --> 00:01:59.790
You've buried your head in the wall for over 10 minutes
Subbed by EP of Bayi Subs

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:02.160
You've buried your head in the wall for over 10 minutes

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:05.070
There's limit to having post death depression

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:06.640
Who says I'm depressed?

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:08.240
I'm waiting for an opportunity

00:02:08.249 --> 00:02:09.419
What opportunity?

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:11.000
A chance to reincarnate

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.980
I've figured a way to revive myself

00:02:12.986 --> 00:02:14.310
I can't even be sure on that

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:16.254
You say you've found a way to do it?

00:02:16.254 --> 00:02:17.685
How do you intend to do that?

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:19.200
It's kinda complicated

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:21.590
There's a saying "go back whence you came from"

00:02:21.595 --> 00:02:23.043
From where I was born,

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:25.000
To where I shall return

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:28.630
That pregnant woman will give birth any time soon

00:02:28.639 --> 00:02:30.638
This will be my chance to reincarnate

00:02:32.509 --> 00:02:33.534
Let go of me!

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:34.940
I'm in a hurry to be born!

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:36.180
Stop holding me back!

00:02:37.317 --> 00:02:39.545
I want you to listen clearly

00:02:39.545 --> 00:02:42.842
You won't be able to stay in the state you're in right now

00:02:42.842 --> 00:02:44.846
You'll vanish in 7 days

00:02:44.846 --> 00:02:46.690
Once your time is up,

00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:49.820
you'll turn into an evil spirit if you stay in this realm

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:52.060
By then, don't blame me for not telling you

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:53.540
I can't hear ya

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:54.380
Can't hear ya

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:55.260
Can't hear

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:56.020
what you say

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:57.510
Speak louder

00:02:57.721 --> 00:02:59.890
I'm so innocent

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:01.256
How could I turn evil?

00:03:01.256 --> 00:03:03.296
You just wanna force me to serve you

00:03:03.296 --> 00:03:04.319
Not a chance

00:03:07.222 --> 00:03:08.293
A ghost!

00:03:09.215 --> 00:03:10.541
That's refreshing

00:03:10.541 --> 00:03:12.447
A ghost that's scared of ghost

00:03:12.447 --> 00:03:13.636
Yangming Master

00:03:13.636 --> 00:03:17.183
I'm not done settling with you

00:03:17.183 --> 00:03:18.652
She's just a Loli

00:03:18.652 --> 00:03:19.903
You made me jump

00:03:19.903 --> 00:03:22.093
I buy you some lollipops, okay?

00:03:22.093 --> 00:03:23.295
Don't like it?

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:24.240
How about a banana?

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:25.420
Perhaps, a durian?

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:26.080
Here

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:27.310
Open your mouth

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:35.750
My gosh

00:03:35.755 --> 00:03:37.021
Quite a loud mouth

00:03:37.021 --> 00:03:38.429
I got instantly blown off

00:03:38.429 --> 00:03:42.413
Wasn't she the runaway Loli that I saw previously?

00:03:42.413 --> 00:03:44.679
She looks more powerful than before

00:03:44.679 --> 00:03:46.409
Can that Korean Priest

00:03:46.409 --> 00:03:47.691
fight against her?

00:03:47.691 --> 00:03:48.880
Yangming Master

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.118
Give me

00:03:50.118 --> 00:03:52.159
Give me your spiritual power

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:54.700
You thought hiding in the hospital

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:56.500
by sucking rotten chi of the dead

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:58.180
would make you to win the fight?

00:03:58.180 --> 00:04:00.380
You never know if you never try

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.780
So stubborn

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:02.890
Exterminate!

00:04:02.899 --> 00:04:06.777
Shouldn't you be more attentive to your partner before you attack?

00:04:06.777 --> 00:04:08.358
What is this thing?

00:04:08.358 --> 00:04:09.104
Go away!

00:04:09.104 --> 00:04:09.962
Leave me alone!

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:12.120
They plan to

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:13.480
forcefully turn him evil?

00:04:13.482 --> 00:04:14.564
I'm so careless!

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:20.590
Damn it

00:04:20.592 --> 00:04:22.526
I can't concentrate fully

00:04:24.861 --> 00:04:25.926
Yangming Master

00:04:25.926 --> 00:04:27.036
Can't you see

00:04:27.036 --> 00:04:28.738
I'm all tied up?

00:04:28.738 --> 00:04:30.645
Cast a spell quick!

00:04:33.748 --> 00:04:36.344
I never expect the great Yangming Master

00:04:36.344 --> 00:04:38.481
would get tied down by a spirit

00:04:38.481 --> 00:04:40.029
How unusual

00:04:40.763 --> 00:04:42.155
Let me go!

00:04:42.155 --> 00:04:45.156
Where are you taking me?

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:51.755
You won't dare to give a shot?

00:04:53.422 --> 00:04:57.108
We thought we can't beat you against the power that you have

00:04:57.108 --> 00:04:59.407
but if you don't want to lose him

00:04:59.407 --> 00:05:01.968
You better give up your power

00:05:01.968 --> 00:05:05.203
After midnight, he will turn evil

00:05:05.203 --> 00:05:06.396
By then,

00:05:06.396 --> 00:05:09.064
you'll have to kill him yourself

00:05:09.064 --> 00:05:12.360
Come look for us behind the hill once you've made up your mind

00:05:30.097 --> 00:05:31.546
What's going on?

00:05:33.721 --> 00:05:37.081
He's the one chosen as the Yangming Master's Soul Image?

00:05:37.081 --> 00:05:39.261
He looks ordinary

00:05:39.261 --> 00:05:41.519
If we eat him, we might gain some powers

00:05:41.519 --> 00:05:42.819
Bro, sis, Happy New Year

00:05:42.819 --> 00:05:44.850
Have you eaten yet?  If no, I treat you supper

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:47.597
He's so skinny, there isn't much to squeeze out of him

00:05:47.597 --> 00:05:49.070
Don't even try

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:51.973
He is our special guest

00:05:51.973 --> 00:05:54.864
If we want to obtain Yangming Master's power

00:05:54.864 --> 00:05:57.240
we still need him to be the bait

00:05:57.240 --> 00:05:59.160
That Yangming Master you mention

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:00.420
What kind of guy is he?

00:06:00.426 --> 00:06:03.160
Isn't he just a Korean styled Taoist Priest?

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:05.334
A Taoist Priest?

00:06:12.565 --> 00:06:13.708
Listen

00:06:13.708 --> 00:06:17.380
There're many different kinds of exorcists since ancient times

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:19.695
And those known as the Yangming Masters

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:23.640
are held by the Duanmu family who're the greatest among all exorcists

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:25.220
And that man

00:06:25.222 --> 00:06:27.693
is the head exorcist of the Duanmu family

00:06:27.693 --> 00:06:31.102
He has unlimited spiritual power hidden in his body

00:06:31.102 --> 00:06:33.271
Whoever obtains his power

00:06:33.271 --> 00:06:35.161
will become invincible

00:06:35.161 --> 00:06:37.723
and also get the chance to reincarnate

00:06:37.720 --> 00:06:42.820
He has Tangseng's flesh? I wanna try too
(In Journey to the West story, anyone who eats Tangseng's flesh will gain immortality.)

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:44.400
Thanks so much, girl

00:06:44.409 --> 00:06:45.851
Since everyone's a ghost

00:06:45.851 --> 00:06:48.048
Let's share the bounty together

00:06:48.048 --> 00:06:50.435
I'll draw him over before he gets suspicious

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:51.840
You ready a sneak attack

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:53.800
We'll get to eat Tangseng's flesh~

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:55.510
I'll be reborn soon

00:06:57.944 --> 00:06:58.976
Let's go

00:06:58.976 --> 00:07:01.821
You let him go just like that?

00:07:01.821 --> 00:07:03.352
Just wait and see

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:08.689
Good thing I've got excellent acting skill

00:07:13.595 --> 00:07:14.752
You brat

00:07:14.752 --> 00:07:17.034
How did they let you escape?

00:07:17.477 --> 00:07:20.988
That's 'coz I'm Mr. smarty pants

00:07:20.988 --> 00:07:23.493
They won't let you escape that easily

00:07:23.493 --> 00:07:25.880
Besides, the evil spell on your body

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:28.456
won't simply stop right there

00:07:28.659 --> 00:07:29.574
Here

00:07:29.574 --> 00:07:31.459
Only this can save you

00:07:32.345 --> 00:07:33.723
Rings?

00:07:33.723 --> 00:07:35.552
These are the Soul Binding Rings

00:07:35.552 --> 00:07:37.939
Wear them then the contract is sealed

00:07:37.939 --> 00:07:39.675
and you become my Soul Image

00:07:39.675 --> 00:07:40.865
All this while

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:42.440
you still want me to serve you

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.210
Not wanna

00:07:44.028 --> 00:07:45.186
Alright

00:07:45.186 --> 00:07:48.346
Then I'll wait and watch you turn into an evil spirit

00:07:48.346 --> 00:07:49.403
After that,

00:07:49.403 --> 00:07:51.940
you're f*cked till you bite the dust

00:08:01.423 --> 00:08:02.684
Fool

00:08:02.684 --> 00:08:05.358
The head of Duanmu is nothing special

00:08:05.358 --> 00:08:08.719
Humans are so easily swayed by sympathy

00:08:08.719 --> 00:08:13.545
I knew Yangming Master can transfer power to his Soul Image

00:08:13.545 --> 00:08:16.560
He can no longer break the contract once it's sealed

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:18.905
Or else we will both perish

00:08:18.905 --> 00:08:21.732
Once I wear the rings

00:08:21.732 --> 00:08:25.312
His power shall be mine

00:08:32.229 --> 00:08:33.948
You've seen through my plan

00:08:34.597 --> 00:08:36.877
Your acting skill is so amateur

00:08:36.877 --> 00:08:38.391
Based on his personality,

00:08:38.391 --> 00:08:41.268
would he simply agree to sign the contract?

00:08:41.268 --> 00:08:44.471
Besides, he hasn't even asked about the prerequisites

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:46.780
Seems like our effort has gone wasted

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:48.970
None other than to seize it by force

00:08:48.973 --> 00:08:50.549
Just the few of you?

00:08:50.549 --> 00:08:52.368
You're quite foolhardy, aren't you?

00:08:56.239 --> 00:08:59.132
In order to gain your power,

00:08:59.132 --> 00:09:01.708
every evil spirits in the hill

00:09:01.708 --> 00:09:04.163
are raging to take you down

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:07.960
Furthermore, we're still holding a hostage

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:09.880
Just turn me into an evil spirit now

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:12.401
I'd rather die than to let you use me

00:09:12.401 --> 00:09:14.101
What are you waiting for?

00:09:14.101 --> 00:09:15.288
Get him!

00:09:20.161 --> 00:09:21.755
He's really strong

00:09:21.755 --> 00:09:23.129
He's all by himself

00:09:23.129 --> 00:09:25.466
Let's see how long he can last with his power

00:09:25.466 --> 00:09:27.326
He won't get out of here alive

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:28.300
Catch!

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:30.859
The rings

00:09:30.859 --> 00:09:32.764
You tryna force me into marriage?

00:09:33.599 --> 00:09:34.395
Wear it!

00:09:34.395 --> 00:09:35.631
And be my Soul Image!

00:09:35.631 --> 00:09:37.693
How would I know you won't blackmail me?

00:09:37.690 --> 00:09:39.280
I've not even seen the contract

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:41.540
If I get bound eternally, I'd end up losing

00:09:42.465 --> 00:09:44.313
You're right

00:09:44.313 --> 00:09:46.855
Once the contract is sealed,

00:09:46.855 --> 00:09:48.559
both of you will be bound for life

00:09:48.559 --> 00:09:51.355
But this will be the only way to retain your soul

00:09:51.355 --> 00:09:54.466
When did they gather so much negative energy?

00:09:54.466 --> 00:09:57.495
They're prepared to finish you off

00:10:01.190 --> 00:10:02.643
Duanmu!

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:08.672
Can't believe I'd fearfully risk my life for a feeble spirit

00:10:08.672 --> 00:10:12.018
If you're still that fussy, then forget it

00:10:12.018 --> 00:10:17.019
I might as well destroy everything on this hill, including you

00:10:17.738 --> 00:10:19.710
You aren't serious

00:10:19.710 --> 00:10:20.846
Wait

00:10:20.846 --> 00:10:21.988
Let me try

00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:26.291
You're almost dying and you still squabble?

00:10:50.985 --> 00:10:51.952
That...

00:10:51.952 --> 00:10:54.966
That's the true power of a Yangming Master?

00:11:06.950 --> 00:11:08.240
Don't come any closer

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:09.420
It's not my fault

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:11.000
These people deserved to die

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.050
It's too late to ask for forgiveness

00:11:13.055 --> 00:11:14.788
You chose to be fallen

00:11:14.780 --> 00:11:16.200
There's no turning back

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:18.200
I'm innocent

00:11:18.205 --> 00:11:19.902
The society's the one to blame

00:11:19.902 --> 00:11:21.183
The world is at fault

00:11:21.183 --> 00:11:23.188
I don't want to die

00:11:23.180 --> 00:11:25.920
I feel so energized

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:28.820
Is this the legendary power up skill?

00:11:28.860 --> 00:11:30.620
All your unfinished business

00:11:30.623 --> 00:11:32.061
I'm taking them all out

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:36.220
-"Everything in this world, I'll watch over it"
-No, please give me one more chance!

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:37.510
Go in peace

00:11:37.516 --> 00:11:39.703
Is this how a Yangming Master purify souls?

00:11:39.703 --> 00:11:41.357
Looks more like a murder scene

00:11:41.350 --> 00:11:42.420
She's already dead

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:44.020
but she didn't want to move on

00:11:44.290 --> 00:11:45.520
and caused havoc

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:46.890
It's best to get rid of her

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:48.282
But she's so young

00:11:48.282 --> 00:11:50.793
Why won't you give her the chance to amend herself?

00:11:53.114 --> 00:11:54.121
Come here

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:56.440
Let me show you the reality

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:05.420
W-What's this?

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:07.540
She killed so many people when she's alive?

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:09.430
She was once a serial killer

00:12:09.439 --> 00:12:11.064
What you saw previously

00:12:11.064 --> 00:12:13.348
was her last retained innocent look

00:12:13.348 --> 00:12:16.110
I don't intend to find out why she changed

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:17.658
Although I felt sorry for her,

00:12:17.658 --> 00:12:19.787
that doesn't mean she should be pardoned

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:22.800
Did you hear what I said?

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:26.240
It's important for you to remember this for your upcoming duties

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:27.370
I've been wondering

00:12:27.374 --> 00:12:30.515
You actually provoke me to sign the contract, didn't you?

00:12:32.912 --> 00:12:33.959
Understood

00:12:33.959 --> 00:12:35.069
Answer me!

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:36.080
Stop pretend a call

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:36.720
Alright

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:39.040
This is our first job working together

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:39.920
What is it?

00:12:39.927 --> 00:12:41.520
Catching a flight (*Jie Ji)

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:44.420
Arcade machine?   (*Ji-e Ji)

00:12:44.420 --> 00:12:46.030
You wanna play a game with me?

00:12:58.250 --> 00:12:59.140
Excuse me

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:01.320
Could you take off your hat and glasses?

00:13:06.503 --> 00:13:07.955
How's that?

00:13:12.029 --> 00:13:15.717
Looking at the stars

00:13:15.717 --> 00:13:21.982
Traveling through the sky with the cold moon

00:13:22.828 --> 00:13:26.316
Speak softly of

00:13:26.316 --> 00:13:33.438
the unspeakable yearnings

00:13:33.438 --> 00:13:37.077
Let the memories

00:13:37.077 --> 00:13:43.733
gets frozen as poems in the long night

00:13:44.051 --> 00:13:48.047
Let everything

00:13:48.047 --> 00:13:54.627
sunk faintly into silence

00:14:05.187 --> 00:14:09.250
while still carry

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:15.502
the longing for the light

00:14:26.363 --> 00:14:30.249
is hope

00:14:30.737 --> 00:14:36.316
is metamorphosis
